srchdsh
=======

srchdsh is a derivative work of srchd, a metasearch engine by cmcevoy.

    Upstream:  https://git.sr.ht/~cmcevoy/srchd
    Commit:    317dd45330c52cf139621bdcd8efe346245db535
    Date:      2025-09-14 ("ddg: use html.duckduckgo.com")

The search engine implementations, the fan-out and merge logic, the scoring,
the configuration format and the blacklist implementation come from srchd and
remain under its licence, the GNU Affero General Public License version 3. See
LICENSE for the full text.

Changes in this fork:

  - the search path is decoupled from net/http, and the web interface
    (templates, static files, settings, OpenSearch, stats) is removed;
  - a command-line interface with a JSON document, and an optional HTTP mode
    serving the same document;
  - Startpage and Mojeek engines, with their challenge solvers and a small
    persistent cache.

Because srchdsh is a derivative of an AGPL-3.0 program, it is licensed under the
AGPL-3.0 as a whole and cannot be relicensed.
